1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
AI references looking real is actually terrifying

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,000
so I do not trust the citation blindly

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
paste it into Verify References

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
check the title, authors, and source details

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,500
and if I only have a claim, I can find sources too

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,000
not every academic-looking citation deserves trust
